<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SDP WINS LOCAL, CENTRE PARTY TOPS EUROPOLL.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SDP WINS LOCAL, CENTRE PARTY TOPS EUROPOLL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Support for the main parties in</p>
<p>Finland's local government election according to preliminary</p>
<p>results on Sunday, 98.4 percent of votes counted (figs in pct):</p>
<p>			 Municipal	    Parliament     Municipal</p>
<p>		     election 1996	election 1995  election 1992</p>
<p> SDP		     24.6		   28.3	     27.1</p>
<p> Centre Party	  22.0		   19.8	     19.2</p>
<p> Conservatives	 21.6		   17.9	     19.1</p>
<p> Leftist Alliance    10.4		   11.2	     11.7</p>
<p> Green Party	    6.1		    6.5		6.9</p>
<p> Swedish Party	  5.4		    5.1		5.0</p>
<p> Christian League     3.2		    3.0		3.2</p>
<p> Young Finns	    1.3		    2.8		N/A</p>
<p>Support for the main parties in Finland's European</p>
<p>Parliament election according to preliminary results on Sunday,</p>
<p>97.8 percent of votes counted:</p>
<p>			   Euro-MP		Euro-MP	  Euro-MP</p>
<p>			election 1996	election 1996    seats 1995</p>
<p> Centre Party	  24.5 pct	     4 seats	     5</p>
<p> SDP		     21.5 pct	     4 seats	     4</p>
<p> Conservatives	 20.1 pct	     4 seats	     4</p>
<p> Leftist Alliance    10.5 pct	     2 seats	     1</p>
<p> Green Party	    7.5 pct	     1 seat		1</p>
<p> Swedish Party	  5.7 pct	     1 seat		1</p>
<p> Young Finns	    3.0 pct	     nil		  nil</p>
<p> Christian League     2.8 pct	     nil		  nil</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
